# The repo is authored with LF. Force LF on checkout everywhere: git's default CRLF
# conversion on Windows breaks tests that assert on file contents byte-for-byte
# (packages/sync-client/src/__tests__/rig-latency-page.test.ts reads rig/latency.html
# and expects literal \n).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
